<div n="3"> <head>4.</head> <lb/>
<p><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">H</hi>: Berlin. 4 S. 8°. <hi rendition="#i">K</hi>:</hi> v. Meu&#x017F;ebach in Dillingen den 7 Jenn. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">J</hi>:<lb/>
